option.DEFERRED_LIGHTING=Deferred lighting
option.DEFERRED_LIGHTING.comment=Lights opaque terrain in a separate pass. Water and other translucent geometry remain forward rendered.
option.SCREEN_AO=Screen-space ambient occlusion
option.SCREEN_AO.comment=Estimates near-field occlusion in the deferred terrain pass.
option.SOFT_SHADOWS=Contact-hardening shadows
option.SOFT_SHADOWS.comment=Searches for blockers to adjust the shadow filter radius. Requires scene shadows.
option.ADVANCED_WATER=Screen-space water
option.ADVANCED_WATER.comment=Adds waves, refraction, water absorption and screen-space reflections. Requires deferred lighting.
option.AA_MODE=Anti-aliasing method
option.AA_MODE.comment=TAA accumulates terrain and water using depth and normals. Forward rendering falls back to spatial AA. GI history filtering is independent.
value.AA_MODE.0=Off
value.AA_MODE.1=Fast spatial AA
value.AA_MODE.2=Temporal AA
value.AA_MODE.3=Temporal + spatial AA
option.VOLUME_EFFECTS=Volumetric light and clouds
option.VOLUME_EFFECTS.comment=Ray marches a cloud layer and adds sunlit haze.
option.VOXEL_LIGHTING=Colored voxel light (experimental)
option.VOXEL_LIGHTING.comment=Propagates nearby block light in the selected voxel volume. Requires Iris compute and custom images.
option.VOXEL_GRID_SIZE=Voxel grid size
option.VOXEL_GRID_SIZE.comment=Blocks per side at one voxel per block. Larger volumes cover more nearby sources and use more memory and GPU time; propagation remains four steps. Requires colored voxel light.
value.VOXEL_GRID_SIZE.32=32 cubed (0.625 MiB)
value.VOXEL_GRID_SIZE.64=64 cubed (5 MiB)
value.VOXEL_GRID_SIZE.96=96 cubed (16.875 MiB)
value.VOXEL_GRID_SIZE.128=128 cubed (40 MiB)
option.SCREEN_GI=Screen-space diffuse bounce (experimental)
option.SCREEN_GI.comment=Adds one diffuse bounce from visible sunlit and skylit terrain. Requires deferred lighting.
option.SCREEN_GI_HISTORY=Temporal filtering for screen-space GI
option.SCREEN_GI_HISTORY.comment=Reuses nearby sky and sunlight bounce samples from the previous frame. Requires screen-space diffuse bounce and deferred lighting.
option.SCREEN_GI_SPATIAL=Half-resolution screen-space GI (experimental)
option.SCREEN_GI_SPATIAL.comment=Traces indirect light at half resolution and reconstructs it using surface depth and normals. Requires screen-space diffuse bounce and deferred lighting.
option.VOXEL_GI=Voxel diffuse bounce (experimental)
option.VOXEL_GI.comment=Estimates bounced block light near supported solid blocks and blends with screen-space samples. Requires voxel lighting and deferred lighting.
option.LITE_LIGHTING=Lite lighting
option.LITE_LIGHTING.comment=Uses diffuse direct lighting and a simpler sky gradient.
option.SCENE_SHADOWS=Scene shadows
option.SCENE_SHADOWS.comment=Draws a shadow map for nearby geometry.
option.SHADOW_MAP=Shadow map resolution
option.SHADOW_MAP.comment=Automatic uses 512 pixels in forward rendering and 1024 in deferred rendering.
value.SHADOW_MAP.0=Automatic
option.SHADOW_RANGE=Shadow draw distance
option.SHADOW_RANGE.comment=Defines how far from the camera geometry casts shadows, in blocks.
option.EXPOSURE=Exposure (EV)
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Adjusts scene brightness before the display transform.
option.SHOW_COLOR_CHART=Show color chart
option.SHOW_COLOR_CHART.comment=Displays fixed scene-linear swatches at the top of the view.
option.SOFT_COLOR=Soft fallback colors
option.SOFT_COLOR.comment=Used by the P0 comparison renderer. The three vanilla dimensions use the linear lighting display transform.
