option.SUNLIGHT_STRENGTH=Sun and moon intensity
option.AMBIENT_STRENGTH=Ambient light intensity
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH=Vanilla block light intensity
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts vanilla lightmap illumination. Colored voxel light retains its calibrated emitter intensity.
option.NETHER_AMBIENT=Nether ambient intensity
option.END_AMBIENT=End ambient intensity
option.WATER_BIOME_TINT=Biome water tint
option.WATER_BIOME_TINT.comment=Mixes the flat biome color into water scattering. Native water texture and texture alpha are not used.
option.WATER_DENSITY=Water absorption
option.WATER_DENSITY.comment=Higher values absorb light more quickly with depth. Shallow water remains clear.
option.WATER_TURBIDITY=Water turbidity
option.WATER_TURBIDITY.comment=Adds neutral extinction per block. Zero retains only wavelength-dependent absorption.
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH=Wave strength
option.WATER_WAVE_SPEED=Wave speed
option.WATER_WAVE_DETAIL=Wave layers
option.WATER_WAVE_DETAIL.comment=Two, four or eight wave scales. Fewer layers reduce fragment shader cost.
option.WATER_ROUGHNESS=Surface roughness
option.WATER_REFRACTION=Refraction strength
option.WATER_REFLECTION_STEPS=Reflection ray steps
option.WATER_REFLECTION_STEPS.comment=Zero uses sky reflections. Screen-space tracing requires screen-space water and deferred lighting.
option.WAVING_LEAVES=Leaf movement
option.WAVING_GRASS=Grass and flower movement
option.WIND_STRENGTH=Wind strength
option.WIND_SPEED=Wind speed
option.WIND_DISTANCE=Wind draw distance
option.WIND_DISTANCE.comment=Smoothly fades animation with camera distance. Grass stems stay anchored and shadows use the same displacement.
option.MOTION_BLUR=Camera motion blur
option.MOTION_BLUR.comment=Depth-aware blur from camera translation and rotation. Independent moving objects have no motion vectors. Off by default.
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH=Shutter fraction
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH.comment=Fraction of the frame interval used for exposure. 0.5 corresponds to a 180-degree shutter.
option.MOTION_BLUR_SAMPLES=Motion blur samples
option.BLOOM=HDR bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=Extracts linear HDR highlights and composites a quarter-size buffer. Independent of local fog scattering; reuses the existing buffer.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom intensity
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD=Bloom threshold
option.COLOR_SATURATION=Saturation
option.COLOR_CONTRAST=Contrast
option.WHITE_BALANCE=White balance
option.WHITE_BALANCE.comment=Negative values cool the scene; positive values warm it.
option.IMAGE_SHARPENING=Adaptive sharpening
option.IMAGE_SHARPENING.comment=Clamps sharpening to nearby colors to limit halos. Zero removes the additional texture samples.
option.SHADOW_FILTER_TAPS=Shadow filter samples
option.AO_SLICES=AO direction slices
option.AO_STRENGTH=Ambient occlusion strength
option.AERIAL_DENSITY=Aerial perspective density
option.MATERIAL_SSR=Experimental material SSR
option.DH_SHADOWS=Experimental DH shadows
option.PROJECTION_JITTER=Projection sampling
option.PROJECTION_JITTER.comment=Fixed is the verified compatibility mode and retains temporal accumulation. Dynamic remains available for testing but can flicker on advanced tiers. Auto retains the previous profile-independent rule.
value.PROJECTION_JITTER.0=Auto (recommended)
value.PROJECTION_JITTER.1=Fixed pixel centers
value.PROJECTION_JITTER.2=Dynamic subpixel sampling
option.PHYSICAL_ATMOSPHERE=Experimental physical atmosphere LUTs
option.PHYSICAL_ATMOSPHERE.comment=GPU spherical atmosphere with spectral transmission, multiple scattering, sky and aerial perspective. Uses a clear-air base with approximate rain blending.
option.INCREMENTAL_VOXELS=Experimental incremental voxel light
option.INCREMENTAL_VOXELS.comment=Retain propagation stages in a world-aligned rolling cache. Recompute edited tiles, entering and departing boundaries on camera movement. Extra GPU memory required.
option.MATERIAL_REFLECTION_STEPS=Material SSR steps
option.CLOUD_STEPS=Cloud integration steps
option.SHAFT_STEPS=Light shaft steps
option.DH_SHADOW_STEPS=DH far shadow steps

option.HIZ_MODE=Hi-Z tracing mode
option.HIZ_MODE.comment=Adaptive preserves the original ray budget and rejects proven-empty intervals. Full traversal may cost more GPU time.
value.HIZ_MODE.0=Off
value.HIZ_MODE.1=Adaptive
value.HIZ_MODE.2=Full traversal

option.ADAPTIVE_SHADING=Visibility-adaptive shading
option.ADAPTIVE_SHADING.comment=Preserve near detail and reduce low-contribution reflection and indirect shadow work.
option.TEMPORAL_REUSE=Static temporal reuse
option.TEMPORAL_REUSE.comment=Enables the static TAA shortcut and alternate GI refresh. GI dimension scope is controlled separately.
option.ADAPTIVE_SHADOWS=Adaptive shadow filtering
option.ADAPTIVE_SHADOWS.comment=Full near-field samples, fewer distant blocker and filter taps.

option.GI_REUSE_MODE=Indirect lighting reuse scope
option.GI_REUSE_MODE.comment=Auto reuses half-resolution GI in Nether and End only, avoiding additional history copies in Overworld. All dimensions is available for A/B comparison.
value.GI_REUSE_MODE.0=Off
value.GI_REUSE_MODE.1=Auto
value.GI_REUSE_MODE.2=All dimensions

option.EMISSION_STRENGTH=Emissive material intensity
option.EMISSION_STRENGTH.comment=Increase linear HDR emission while retaining texture hue and detail.
option.LOCAL_GLOW_STRENGTH=Local fog glow
option.LOCAL_GLOW_STRENGTH.comment=Strength of colored voxel light scattering, without lifting global haze.
option.DARK_AMBIENT=Dark ambient lighting
option.DARK_AMBIENT.comment=Reduce ambient floor and low skylight, 1.0 restores previous ambient strength.

screen.GLOW=Emitters and glow
screen.GLOW.comment=Independent emissive surfaces, local air scattering and screen bloom.
screen.TEMPORAL_SETTINGS=Temporal reuse
screen.TEMPORAL_SETTINGS.comment=Adjust history reuse scope for dimension-specific performance.
option.BLOOM_FILTER=Bloom filter quality
option.BLOOM_FILTER.comment=Fast uses one composite sample; Balanced uses four; Wide uses nine for a broader halo at higher cost.
value.BLOOM_FILTER.0=Fast
value.BLOOM_FILTER.1=Balanced
value.BLOOM_FILTER.2=Wide
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the screen-space halo, not physical scene illumination.
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD.comment=Only sufficiently bright HDR highlights contribute. Lower thresholds increase glow.

option.AO_RECONSTRUCTION=Ambient occlusion computation
option.AO_RECONSTRUCTION.comment=Adaptive shares the Overworld half-resolution GI pass, with full GTAO near the eye and at geometry mismatches. Dynamic projection retains the original path.
value.AO_RECONSTRUCTION.0=Full resolution
value.AO_RECONSTRUCTION.1=Adaptive

option.SHADOW_HYBRID=Hybrid hardware shadow filtering
option.SHADOW_HYBRID.comment=Uses GPU comparison sampling when supported; sloped receivers retain software plane correction.
value.SHADOW_HYBRID.0=Software
value.SHADOW_HYBRID.1=Auto hybrid
option.GLOW_SOFTNESS=Local glow softness
option.GLOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Smoothly compresses dense local scattering to avoid a flat veil; 0 restores linear scattering.

option.VOXEL_FUSION=Fused voxel propagation
option.VOXEL_FUSION.comment=Combines four iterations into two shared-memory passes, retaining step count and half-float intermediates. Disable for the original four-pass path.
value.VOXEL_FUSION.0=Four passes
value.VOXEL_FUSION.1=Fused pairs

option.VOLUME_RECONSTRUCTION=Cloud and shaft reconstruction
option.VOLUME_RECONSTRUCTION.comment=Fixed-grid Overworld shares the half-resolution GI buffer, with depth-aware full-resolution fallback.
value.VOLUME_RECONSTRUCTION.0=Full resolution
value.VOLUME_RECONSTRUCTION.1=Adaptive
option.HDR_REUSE=HDR frame reuse
option.HDR_REUSE.comment=Read TAA history RGB directly for display; retain the original path when motion blur is enabled.
value.HDR_REUSE.0=Original
value.HDR_REUSE.1=Auto reuse

screen.DIMENSION_BUDGETS=Dimension-specific budgets
screen.DIMENSION_BUDGETS.comment=Choose per dimension using matched GPU measurements. No live profile switching or near-quality reduction.
option.OVERWORLD_BUDGET=Overworld budget
option.OVERWORLD_BUDGET.comment=Full retains distant taps; Balanced uses current adaptive budgets; Performance reduces distant work earlier, retaining near detail.
value.OVERWORLD_BUDGET.0=Full
value.OVERWORLD_BUDGET.1=Balanced
value.OVERWORLD_BUDGET.2=Performance
option.NETHER_BUDGET=Nether budget
option.NETHER_BUDGET.comment=Full retains distant taps; Balanced uses current adaptive budgets; Performance reduces distant work earlier, retaining near detail.
value.NETHER_BUDGET.0=Full
value.NETHER_BUDGET.1=Balanced
value.NETHER_BUDGET.2=Performance
option.END_BUDGET=End budget
option.END_BUDGET.comment=Full retains distant taps; Balanced uses current adaptive budgets; Performance reduces distant work earlier, retaining near detail.
value.END_BUDGET.0=Full
value.END_BUDGET.1=Balanced
value.END_BUDGET.2=Performance

